  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_007_model_01",
      "hash64": "B8594BA315835615",
      "text": "想知道你的宝可梦有多努力吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_007_model_02",
      "hash64": "B85948A3158350FC",
      "text": "想知道哪一只宝可梦\\n有多努力呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_007_model_03",
      "hash64": "B85949A3158352AF",
      "text": "那么让我看看\\n[VAR 0x0102(0001)]的努力程度吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_007_model_04a",
      "hash64": "C300FE1D8E1D7AB5",
      "text": "嗯嗯……咦……这是……\\n天哪……啊啊……竟然会有这种事！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_007_model_04b",
      "hash64": "C300FB1D8E1D759C",
      "text": "嗯嗯……原来如此……\\n啊啊～……这样啊……哦～……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_007_model_05a",
      "hash64": "C303E21D8E1F80F8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0102(0001)]你呀……\\c\\n真的非～常努力呢！\\n我来给你戴上努力过的证明！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_007_model_05b",
      "hash64": "C303E51D8E1F8611",
      "text": "……嗯！\\n试着再努力看看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_007_model_06",
      "hash64": "B85944A315834A30",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0102(0001)]\\n戴上了努力奖章！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_007_model_07",
      "hash64": "B85945A315834BE3",
      "text": "你的宝可梦\\n和努力奖章很相衬哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_007_model_08",
      "hash64": "B85952A3158361FA",
      "text": "哦，真是遗憾……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_007_model_09",
      "hash64": "B85953A3158363AD",
      "text": "宝可梦对战得越多，\\n努力程度就会积累得越高哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
